Client#world-targets","content":"Each option is a prompt entry: `label`, plus `control` or `keybind` (or `key` / `keyboard` / `gamepad` / `icon`). `name` is how you remove or replace that prompt later. `groups`, `items`, `anyItem`, `canInteract`, and `allowInVehicle` use the same rules as a manual prompt."},"3767":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-119","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"`distance` defaults to `config.defaultPromptDistance` (2). An optional third argument sets the HUD slot and a default distance for that call:"},"3768":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-120","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"Several targets can be on screen at once. Each one is its own group."},"3769":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-121","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"Target"},"3770":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-122","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"What shows"},"3771":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-123","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"Coord"},"3772":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-124","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"One group per point, while the player is in range of that point"},"3773":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-125","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"Local entity or network id"},"3774":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-126","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"That entity's prompts, plus model and global prompts when it is the closest match"},"3775":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-127","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"Model"},"3776":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-128","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"The closest entity of that model"},"3777":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-129","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"Global ped, vehicle, object, or player"},"3778":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-130","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"The closest entity of that type"},"3779":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-131","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"Model prompts and global prompts attach to that closest entity. Prompts registered on the entity itself are merged into the same group, specific ones first, then model, then global. A second car nearby does not get a second copy of a global vehicle prompt."},"3780":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-132","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"`canInteract` receives `(entity, distance, coords, name)`. Coord targets pass `entity` as `0`. The action payload adds `entity`, `coords`, `distance`, and `coordId` when the prompt is tied to a target. `serverEvent` sends a network id instead of the client handle, or `0` when the entity is local."},"3781":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-133","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#world-targets","content":"`hide` and `hideAll` clear the HUD. They do not unregister a world target, so a prompt in range comes back on the next check. `remove*` drops it. Stopping the resource that registered it drops it too."},"3782":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-134","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#parameters-2","content":"Parameter"},"3783":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-135","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#parameters-2","content":"Type"},"3784":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-136","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#parameters-2","content":"Description"},"3785":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-137","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#parameters-2","content":"`coords`"},"3786":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-138","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#parameters-2","content":"`vector3 \\| vector3[]`"},"3787":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-139","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#parameters-2","content":"One point, an array of points, or `{ x, y, z }`"},"3788":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-140","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#parameters-2","content":"`options`"},"3789":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-141","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#parameters-2","content":"`PromptEntry \\| PromptEntry[]`"},"3790":{"id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client-142","page_id":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/prompts/exports/Client#parameters-2","content":"One prompt or an array"},"3791